@startuml
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant "Shared Application" as App
participant "Shared Session State" as State
participant "Shared Domain Contract" as Domain
participant "Connected Teacher and Student Clients" as Clients
Teacher -> App: Open /
App --> Teacher: Show shared home and role entries
Student -> App: Open /
App --> Student: Show shared home and role entries
Teacher -> App: Navigate to /teacher/login or /teacher/dashboard
App --> Teacher: Show teacher route placeholder
Student -> App: Navigate to /student/join or /student/session/:sessionId
App --> Student: Show student route placeholder
Teacher -> App: Select next question
App -> State: Create Round and set target to Waiting
State --> App: Waiting with current Round
State -> Clients: Notify connected users of target, Round and Waiting
Teacher -> App: Start current question
App -> State: Activate current Round
State --> App: Active
State -> Clients: Notify connected users of Active
Teacher -> App: End current Round
App -> State: Set Ended and expose current result
State --> App: Ended; result available
State -> Clients: Notify connected users of Ended and result availability
note over App,Clients
When connected, both teacher and student clients
show every phase change within 2 seconds.
end note
Teacher -> App: Reopen ended question
App -> State: Create distinct Round and set Waiting
State --> App: Waiting with new Round
State -> Clients: Notify connected users of new Round and Waiting
Teacher -> App: Start reopened question
App -> State: Activate existing new Round
State --> App: Active
State -> Clients: Notify connected users of Active
App -> State: On completion, replace prior result with new result
State -> Clients: Notify connected users that result is available
Teacher -> App: View current state
App -> State: Read shared state
State --> App: Waiting / active / ended
App --> Teacher: Show route placeholder and state
Student -> App: View current state
App -> State: Read shared state
State --> App: Waiting / active / ended
App -> Domain: Read current question and blanks
Domain --> App: Question and blank concepts
App --> Student: Show route placeholder and shared state
note over Teacher,Student
Business actions such as teacher authentication,
student joining and answer submission belong
to subsequent features.
end note
@enduml
